# Session discipline

- Source of truth for what to build next: `roadmap.md`
- One **Day** per session (3×25). Do not pull the next Day mid-session unless the user asks
- Mark checklist items `[x]` only when that item’s work is done; mark Day Exit only when Exit criteria pass
- Prefer small commits at session end with a message that names the Day
- If scaffolding conflicts with later Days (e.g. sample counter vs vault), keep the sample until the Day that replaces it — don’t rewrite Month 2 early
